// max-iterations: must be numeric like delay, but also must be >0.
// Validation: first check numeric parsing like delay (must have digit). If fails => invalid max iteration error.
// If passes, parse integer value ignoring trailing junk? Need to parse leading spaces, sign, digits, etc., then check value >0.
// For "1.5", parse as 1 -> valid and >0 => CURSES.
